+{
+  "file": "src/agents.ts",
+  "snippet": "toolChoice: 'required',",
+  "cause": "The refundAgent sets toolChoice 'required', which the Gemini plugin maps to function-calling mode ANY, so after the supervisor declines approveRefund the model must call another tool on every turn and can never reply in text, so it loops, re-requests approval, or fails at maxTurns.",
+  "evidence": "src/agents.ts line 43 sets toolChoice: 'required' on refundAgent (triage uses 'auto'); node_modules/@genkit-ai/google-genai/lib/common/converters.js:299-300 maps 'required' to FunctionCallingMode.ANY, and the agent system prompt leaves no text-reply path after a decline. Changing it to 'auto' lets the model end the turn with a text reply. Type-check (tsc --noEmit) passes; the model behavior was not run live because no API call was made."
+}
